package: zigbee
description: This component handles the retrieval of diagnostic information from the stack through the diagnostic cluster. Implement the component as follows. 1. Mark all diagnostic attributes you wish to track as external. 2. Add a call to sl_zigbee_af_read_diagnostic_attribute(attributeMetadata, buffer); from sl_zigbee_af_external_attribute_read_cb().
id: zigbee_diagnostic_server
label: Diagnostic Server
category: Zigbee|Cluster Library|Home Automation
quality: evaluation
provides:
- name: zigbee_diagnostic_server
requires:
- name: zigbee_counters
source:
- path: app/framework/plugin/diagnostic-server/diagnostic-server-soc.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_stack_common
- path: app/framework/plugin/diagnostic-server/diagnostic-server-host.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_ezsp
include:
- path: app/framework/plugin/diagnostic-server
  file_list:
  - path: diagnostic-server.h
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: zigbee_diagnostic_server
documentation:
  docset: zigbee
  document: zigbee-af-api/diagnostic-server
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: zigbee
